    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>“This must end for something else to begin.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): Death (Transformer).</strong> You are not annihilation. You are necessary ending, painful transition, and the force that cuts dead things loose so the living can survive.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your archetype strengthens sacrifice, transition, and value recovered from collapse. Your Domain earns <strong>+10 Violence</strong> and <strong>+10 Culture</strong> marks each turn while you serve it.</p></li><li><p><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit.</p></li></ul>",
